  "description": "<main id=\"MainContent\" tabindex=\"-1\" role=\"main\">\r\n<section id=\"shopify-section-template--17848996462884__main\">\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p>InkaLab is a team with a vision for the different, the creative. We like to recognize people like us who think outside the box, and who stand out for their character and appearance.&nbsp;We set out on a mission in 2022 with the goal of creating authentic products that bring out the best in everyone;<br>We design mostly clothing (street t-shirts, hoodies, etc) but we also make things for indoors and outdoors.</p>\r\n<p>We founded this brand to help everyone like us who wants to find themselves in the different and authentic. We all know that famous brands are focused on quantity production, rather than quality, and that leads to a highly polluted environment. By joining our InkaLab family and purchasing our high-quality t-shirt or sweatshirt, you can help limit the large production of poor-quality clothing, and you will be able to enjoy them for much longer. We also offer eco-friendly clothes! Your voice is important - use it through us!</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</main>\r\n<div id=\"shopify-section-sections--17848996528420__footer\"><footer>\r\n<div>\r\n<div style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</footer></div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">After receiving the amount, 10% will be paid<br><br></p>",
